sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 代理商 / 客户用户
    participant App as ReceptivIQ 门户
    participant Auth as Auth + RBAC
    participant Brain as Core AI Brain
    participant Snow as Snowflake
    participant Agent as Pillar Agent
    participant Audit as 审计日志

    User->>App: 请求洞察、报告、persona、创意或媒体建议
    App->>Auth: 校验用户、租户、角色和 client scope
    Auth-->>App: 返回授权上下文
    App->>Brain: 提交带租户上下文的任务
    Brain->>Audit: 记录请求元数据
    Brain->>Snow: 按租户策略查询语义层
    Snow-->>Brain: 返回 RLS 过滤后的 processed data
    Brain->>Agent: 调用对应 pillar agent
    Agent-->>Brain: 返回结构化输出、置信度和引用
    Brain->>Audit: 记录模型、token、数据访问和输出元数据
    Brain-->>App: 返回洞察或建议
    App-->>User: 在门户中展示

